ind  the reference angle ${\\theta }_{R}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\theta }_{R} & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡|\\frac{y}{x}| \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡|\\frac{4}{-3}| \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{4}{3}) \\\\  & ≈0.927\\,295\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we subtract the reference angle from $\\pi :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta  & =\\pi -{\\theta }_{R} \\\\  & ≈\\pi -0.927\\,295 \\\\  & =2.214\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cylindrical coordinates of $C$ are $(5,2.214,-1).$" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297257 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297258 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297259 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297260 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297261 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1041 "selection" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1104 #edb/ref 17592186297259 13194139534587 true] [17592186297256 1110 #uuid "3301c95f-3317-5628-8466-1e3972182a86" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297257 1034 "(\\sqrt{5},3.141,-1)" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534587 true] [17592186297257 1111 #uuid "2065a636-3bd8-5201-977a-317244519985" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297258 1034 "(\\sqrt{5},1.571,-1)" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534587 true] [17592186297258 1111 #uuid "3930bb12-d564-51ce-ba01-3b4f0206a904" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297259 1034 "(5,2.214,-1)" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297259 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534587 true] [17592186297259 1111 #uuid "7c251fc3-ee38-5557-8023-971cd62d5ac5" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297260 1034 "(\\sqrt{10},3.141,-1)" 13194139534587 true] [17592186297260 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534587 true] [17592186297260 1111 #uuid "394e1e0d-82eb-5691-95de-25572ca9515e" 13194139534587 true] [1759218629